    "A campaign pays only when its own balance covers the minutes; a worker below that campaign’s claim threshold waits until more accrues.": "Une campaign ne paie que si son propre solde couvre les minutes ; un worker sous le seuil de réclamation de cette campaign attend que davantage s’accumule.",
